{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "862ca8ba-aea4-4d41-92b6-ab54651fd542",
    "name": "Nexus - Qdrant local (agente t06b)",
    "description": "Revisa la vectorizacion del catalogo de Nexus en el Qdrant local.\n\nAntes: Qdrant corriendo en C:\\qdrant (127.0.0.1:6333) y, para la carpeta 5, Ollama con bge-m3.\nUsa el entorno 'Nexus local'. Corre las carpetas en orden (1 a 5): algunas guardan variables para las siguientes (point_id, activity_id, query_vector).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Salud",
      "description": "Qdrant esta arriba y en que version.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Version de Qdrant",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{qdrant_url}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{qdrant_url}}"
              ],
              "path": []
            },
            "description": "Debe decir 1.19.2 (la de C:\\qdrant)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const v = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('es Qdrant', () => pm.expect(v.title).to.include('qdrant'));",
                  "console.log('Version:', v.version);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Healthz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{qdrant_url}}/healthz",
              "host": [
                "{{qdrant_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "healthz"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('pasa el chequeo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('passed'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Coleccion y alias",
      "description": "La coleccion del catalogo y el alias que usa la busqueda.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar colecciones",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{qdrant_url}}/collections",
              "host": [
                "{{qdrant_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "collections"
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json().result;",
                  "const names = r.collections.map(c => c.name);",
                  "pm.test('existe la coleccion del catalogo', () => pm.expect(names).to.include(pm.environment.get('collection')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Alias",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{qdrant_url}}/aliases",
              "host": [
                "{{qdrant_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "aliases"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El indexador (OfferIndexer) mueve el alias al terminar. Sin alias, la busqueda cae al catalogo de MySQL."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json().result;",
                  "const a = r.aliases.find(x => x.alias_name === pm.environment.get('alias'));",
                  "pm.test('el alias existe', () => pm.expect(a).to.not.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('el alias apunta a la coleccion vigente', () => pm.expect(a.collection_name).to.eql(pm.environment.get('collection')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle de la coleccion",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{qdrant_url}}/collections/{{collection}}",
              "host": [
                "{{qdrant_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "collections",
                "{{collection}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "points_count = ofertas indexadas (una por actividad en casa y una por actividad x lugar). Al 22-oct: 345."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json().result;",
                  "pm.test('estado green', () => pm.expect(r.status).to.eql('green'));",
                  "pm.test('vectores de 1024 (bge-m3) con coseno', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(r.config.params.vectors.size).to.eql(1024);",
                  "  pm.expect(r.config.params.vectors.distance).to.eql('Cosine');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('tiene puntos', () => pm.expect(r.points_count).to.be.above(0));",
                  "const idx = Object.keys(r.payload_schema);",
                  "pm.test('indices de los filtros', () => pm.expect(idx).to.include.members(['activity_id','dimension','location_scope','cost_mxn_pp','duration_min','dayparts','is_outdoor','weather_ok','location']));",
                  "pm.environment.set('points_count', r.points_count);",
                  "console.log('Ofertas indexadas:', r.points_count);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
